WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.375
Step 1: Choose the bell beside search at the top of any page. The red number shows how many notifications you haven’t read yet.

2
00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:19.875
Step 2: Review new messages, required posts, training, agreements, rosters, leave, checklists, equipment problems and other alerts for your permissions and the selected location. Choose a notification to open it; it’s marked as read.

3
00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:29.500
Step 3: Use Unread to see only new items, or Mark all as read to clear the count. Notifications disappear on their own once the work is done.

4
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:40.083
Step 4: Choose the settings button to turn notification types off for your account, or turn on Desktop alerts to get a browser alert while OpStack is open in another tab.
